{"2471800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Something Something Spaceship", "steam_appid": 2471800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5099640], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your spaceship is falling apart. Grab whatever the mainframe wants, dodge whatever it sends after you, and don't ask too many questions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something Something Spaceship is a colourful isometric platform-puzzler inspired by 8-bit classics — explore, evade, and fix your way through a ship that really does not want to cooperate.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/5407ace9ce74e8c20f962783a4c0056a.poster.avif?t=1787250734\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/5407ace9ce74e8c20f962783a4c0056a.webm?t=1787250734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/5407ace9ce74e8c20f962783a4c0056a.mp4?t=1787250734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >128 hand-built rooms across a sprawling, malfunctioning ship — every one hides a puzzle, a shortcut, or a surprise. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piranhas, propeller-blade teddy bears, crazed medi-bots, robot-eating plants, and the odd gnome. Whacky, and out to get you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471800/extras/081d4fb8e45b3921a2997852ee290f77.poster.avif?t=1787250734\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://s